sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant E as Employee (Teams)
  participant Z as Zscaler
  participant A as Apigee
  participant D as AegisDesk agents
  participant C as Context service
  participant M as Model (Bedrock)
  participant P as Policy gateway
  E->>Z: "I need access to FinanceERP"
  Z->>A: Allowed, content inspected
  A->>D: Okta token verified · routed to a healthy cloud
  D->>C: Session, memories, prompt versions
  C-->>D: Context for this user only
  D->>M: Route and choose tools
  M-->>D: Tool call: create_access_request
  D->>P: Evaluate: identity, grants, risk
  P-->>D: ALLOW (medium) · audited
  Note over D,P: Policy requires manager approval: start the approval workflow
  D-->>E: "AR-1102 created, waiting for your manager"
